Script flags are real JS Booleans from game-owner selectors isValid/isShip/
isStation/isPlayer/isDock/isInSpace. isValid transitions to false when
the pinned status becomes STATUS_DEAD. Float properties preserve IEEE-754
binary32 over Exec LONG scalar fields; energy clamps to [0,maxEnergy],
maxEnergy requires >0. Existing original UTF-16 ship-script tests still pass
after widening the host-class properties. Controlled selector-compatible
ObjC fixtures are used, not complete original game entities.
